      "notes": "Not a place. A bucket for chapters of national organisations (Bereaved Parents of the USA and similar) that sit outside the metros we crawl. metro_id is a required field in schema.json and these listings have to carry something honest; inventing a metro for every rural chapter would be worse. The directory page groups by state, not metro, so nothing user-facing depends on this. Marked virtual so the hospice crawler skips it."
